	(text "PASSIVE DERATING  (Tamb max 85C, rail 3.3V+5%)\nC1301  100nF  CL10B104KB8NNNC   V 3.46/50V=6.9% (<=50%) OK; X7R 125C vs Tamb 85C OK\nC1302  100nF  CL10B104KB8NNNC   V 3.46/50V=6.9% (<=50%) OK; X7R 125C vs Tamb 85C OK\nC1303  100nF  CL10B104KB8NNNC   V 3.46/50V=6.9% (<=50%) OK; X7R 125C vs Tamb 85C OK\nR1302  10K    RC0603JR-0710KL   P 1.20mW/82.4mW@85C=1.5% (<=50%) OK; V 3.46/50V=6.9% (<=80%) OK\nR1301  10K    RC0603JR-0710KL   P 1.20mW/82.4mW@85C=1.5% (<=50%) OK; V 3.46/50V=6.9% (<=80%) OK\nAlternates MPN2-4 on each part: same value/package, >= voltage, same dielectric" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 147.32 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d2081416-f269-4ac0-91ce-6d35a9e5a99c"))
